<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-13T23:45:23.693Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:45:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard rescued 29 passengers and crew from a distressed boat in Palawan and then suspended sea travel there because of rough seas, while a landing craft tank sank off Surigao del Sur spilling about 800 liters of oil onto 200 meters of shoreline. The PCG and the Bureau of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources completed a high seas boarding and inspection mission aboard BRP Teresa Magbanua, and a Chinese survey ship entered Scarborough Shoal prompting Manila to summon the Chinese ambassador, as China’s coast guard continued patrols around Diaoyu Dao. Former NPA rebels were redeployed as forest guards to protect Borongan’s environment, and intelligence cooperation was boosted through a workshop by 10ID and partners. 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;SunStar Publishing Inc.&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQZ2ZUOGFfWi1VNXV5TVNIbnp5RElpUWVyaE9nUkFTR1E4eF85eXZITGZDc0JCN29zZ25EbHhtWE15VXZDY0VpLXplNFFVRWptOUJHSlhvM0JYbnNsbzBBWFllaE5fZWZPaGY4dW9xZnhOcEliUzk5MDl1eTE0aGRDUDZmaDdVLTljdlVYRHg5R3Z6WDhKd295UGpNWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOcEF3ak1EbVVLZktXRUNsbjltR2tRZVVRM3hmd0xjeGRmZXNCNzNKNDRjZkt4dWdRSHVESjkwdjJzY0ttODVSWVFaOF8tZ0NrcFdTRExFTFRVOEN5N0l6S0Fmc3VpUmhCTXViT2o4bFhoMHRTVzROU0xCUWhBMWI3TW9jRlhjdEhxcnoxM3hZQWJRdTBCeUFRRTRsYVZxczlDS2FPWHBsYTZLQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The China-Global South Project&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Baird Maritime&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxObjhucjhCNVBLNVJ0SmxUOWVVYlBhMDVjcFk1WjF2X0Uyci01Z3VTUFFkSHhGTlFGb01DZC0zN3oxQVN1WlBsUm5PLXo0VFFVWmJqQjE2cjZJMjNNWEZDbEt2dEw1NUJQTmxOMXlTRDB4RE1n